  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "sense they felt sure of their choice",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "makes me want to protect myself too"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "imagine they made peace with betraying me",
    "sys_rule_justification": "because I don't want to become what they expected"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "picture them feeling something close to guilt",
